# [GITIGNORE WHITELIST HERE]
# How: Ignore everything in this folder, then re-include only our own files.
# Why: bin/start-dev.sh pip-installs dependencies directly into each service
#      folder. Without this, hundreds of library files would be committed and
#      scanned by the Bandit security check in .github/workflows.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.env.sample
!/README.md
!/function.py
!/dev_server.py
!/requirements.txt
!/app/
!/tests/
